    Timeouts : 0 [10 sec.]
 Corpus Size : 265, max file size: 1,024
    Coverage : bb: 850 cmp: 35,516
-----------------------------------[ LOGS ]-----------------------------------
NEW, size:912 (i,b,sw,hw,cmp): 0/0/1/0/1, Tot:0/0/772/0/32216
NEW, size:940 (i,b,sw,hw,cmp): 0/0/1/0/32, Tot:0/0/773/0/32248
